        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International BP-7901, Ornate Gothic Rose for Small Knobs</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThere has been a shift in home decor toward pieces with an old world feel and ornate style. RK International's Fancy Gothic Cabinet Knob Backplate has a richness in material, color, and design. Its curves create movement and flow and that is important especially when dealing with the heaviness of ornate designs. It is available in 5 finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Gothic Cabinet Knob Rose can be used with almost any cabinet knob. Go bold with either the <a href=\"/products/petal-cabinet-knob-rk-international-ck-704\">Dome Petal Cabinet Knob</a> or the <a href=\"/products/ridged-cabinet-knob-rk-international-ck-9307\">Ridged Cabinet Knob</a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International BP-7901, Ornate Curvy Backplate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length: 3-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-G55G1_size.gif?v=1704354738\" width=\"600\" height=\"146\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
