                "description": "RK International BP-7901, Fancy Gothic Cabinet Knob Backplate - There has been a shift in home decor toward pieces with an old world feel and ornate style. RK International's Fancy Gothic Cabinet Knob Backplate has a richness in material, color, and design. Its curves create movement and flow and that is important especially when dealing with the heaviness of ornate designs. It is available in 5 finishes. This Gothic Cabinet Knob Rose can be used with almost any cabinet knob.",
